  "question": {
    "text": "In young double slit experiment, the wavelength of red light is <math> <mrow> <mn>7</mn> <mn>8</mn> <mn>0</mn> <mn>0&nbsp;</mn> <mi>Å</mi> </mrow> </math> and that of blue light is 5200 <math> <mrow> <mi>Å</mi> </mrow> </math> The value of n for which n<sup>th</sup> bright band due to red light coincides with (n + 1)<sup>th</sup> bright band due to blue light, is :",
